{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：23:05 2026-11-13 HKT<br/>發佈時間：23:05 2026-11-13 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：23:05 2026-11-13 HKT</p><img alt=\"粉嶺坪輋貨倉陷火海 燒膠味蔓延北區 消防處籲關閉門窗\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/338ab61599aa0850a7e87fa5c8946d3b/2026-11/collage_59.jpg\"/><p>粉嶺坪輋路近五洲路一個貨倉，周五（11月13日）晚上8時許起火，烈焰濃煙直衝半空，消防接報趕至拖喉灌救，至晚上近10時大致被救熄，事件中無人受傷。其後，消防員繼向火場射水，以降溫散煙。</p><p>火警期間，上水粉嶺一帶街坊紛紛在社交平台表示聞到濃烈燒膠味。消防處呼籲市民，如受到隨風飄散的煙霧和異味影響，可關閉門窗及保持鎮定。</p><img alt=\"現場為粉嶺坪輋路近五洲路一個貨倉。FB：上水人大聯盟\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/49a57d7077c15cd4eb9f7ab95963f50a/2026-11/904051671_10245168481806956_1443603533368904830_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"火警時烈焰濃煙衝天。FB：上水人大聯盟\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dde5d4be0193628ca695ad59e75ab0ca/2026-11/906898550_10245168480886933_7971084643993110202_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"火警時烈焰濃煙衝天。FB：上水人大聯盟\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/28145001a50b52b7f1838db773784750/2026-11/f3.png\"/><img alt=\"消防到場撲救。FB：上水人大聯盟\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1c2cee84cf222cf1c1abfbd848b27bb7/2026-11/904865865_10245168481726954_4091901583493511761_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防到場撲救。FB：上水人大聯盟\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c4d5f5ccee74e9bb477790ee837086e2/2026-11/f4.png\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T15:36:23.697540+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":241,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T15:05:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T15:29:51.202542+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T15:29:51.202542+00:00","content_hash":"78d2e649511c66e24f0961e660c8f071e048c8a678980ee0abafa6dc2170c3c1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}